  "result": "All 617 tests pass and the type check is clean. Summary of the fix:\n\n- **Keys/addresses**: `listTakenProjectSlugs`/new `listTakenProjectKeys` now include archived projects (addresses/keys stay reserved), and `insertProject` uniquifies the chosen/derived key with a new `uniqueProjectKey` helper (`src/lib/slug.ts`), trimming to 4 chars like slugs do.\n- **Plan slots**: `countProjects` now counts only live projects again (was counting all, ignoring its own scope param).\n- **Restore**: `restoreProject` now requires the project to actually be archived (`assertArchived`, new `NotArchivedError`) and re-checks the plan's project quota before restoring; a `project.restored` usage listener was added so the cached meter increments immediately instead of waiting for the periodic recount.\n- **Status**: `updateProject` repository now actually persists `status`; the service enforces that completing a project requires zero open issues (pausing/reactivating/no-op completion are unrestricted), and `createIssue` now refuses to create issues on non-active projects.",
